:941644490,"text":"ああ、戻ってきたんだね！「煙霰ポーション」の効果はどうだった？","nextNodeIds":[716600102,716600105]},{"nodeId":716600102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2564780514,"text":"秘境の外でも使えたらいいな。","nextNodeIds":[716600103]},{"nodeId":716600103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3965409082,"text":"そうそう！それなら完璧だな！","nextNodeIds":[716600104]},{"nodeId":716600104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":2423778114,"text":"ふむふむ。なかなか好感触みたいだね。詳しく話してくれるかい？","nextNodeIds":[716600108]},{"nodeId":716600108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":772616978,"text":"ティマイオスに実験について詳しく話した。","nextNodeIds":[716600109]},{"nodeId":716600109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":499181106,"text":"鶯さんの予想通りだ！","nextNodeIds":[716600110]},{"nodeId":716600110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":2394166282,"text":"「煙霰ポーション」の改善すべき点——それは、昇華後の薬剤の分布を一定範囲内に絞ることだ。","nextNodeIds":[716600111]},{"nodeId":716600111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":100992026,"text":"おそらく…蒲公英の特性を逆に利用し、特殊な補助剤を作ることができれば、空気の流れに影響を受けない薬剤ができるはず。","nextNodeIds":[716600112]},{"nodeId":716600112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":549133450,"text":"だが、これは前例もなく、そう簡単にできることじゃない。テストを何回も重ねることで、その実用性を証明しなければならない…","nextNodeIds":[716600113]},{"nodeId":716600113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":199665858,"text":"なに言ってるんだか、まったく分からないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[716600114]},{"nodeId":716600114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":349982690,"text":"でも、鶯はいつも重要な手がかりをくれるよな。","nextNodeIds":[716600115]},{"nodeId":716600115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","textMapHash":17948338,"text":"あら、こんなことまで予想はしてへんかったで。","nextNodeIds":[716600116]},{"nodeId":716600116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","textMapHash":3714506058,"text":"働き者の錬金術師さん、あんたはうちのことを理解するために頑張っとるん？それとも、うちを褒めて…喜ばせようとしてるんやろか？","nextNodeIds":[716600117]},{"nodeId":716600117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":712594122,"text":"ぼ、僕はただ鶯さんの豊富な知識を尊敬しているだけで…！","nextNodeIds":[716600118]},{"nodeId":716600118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","textMapHash":1180396154,"text":"ふふっ、せやったら頑張らんとなぁ。こういった知識は、今後もどこかで使うかもしれへんよ。","nextNodeIds":[716600119]},{"nodeId":716600119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","textMapHash":3602515474,"text":"あんたの研究が成功したら、うちにも教えたってやぁ。","nextNodeIds":[716600120]},{"nodeId":716600120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":2496201778,"text":"もちろん…その時が来たら、一番上質なポーションを記念品として、鶯さんに贈るよ！","nextNodeIds":[716600121]},{"nodeId":716600121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":2160688370,"text":"それと、もし鶯さんも時間があったら、僕たちと一緒に「万民堂」で…","nextNodeIds":[716600122]},{"nodeId":716600122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","textMapHash":4116413122,"text":"今回の「学術交流」はここまで。「春香窯」には、まだまだたくさん仕事が残っとってな。","nextNodeIds":[716600123]},{"nodeId":716600123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","textMapHash":4170422090,"text":"暇ができたら、次は必ずうちに付き合うてや。","nextNodeIds":[716600124]},{"nodeId":716600124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2356589546,"text":"約束するよ。","nextNodeIds":[716600125]},{"nodeId":716600125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2980108626,"text":"ありがとうな、鶯！","nextNodeIds":[716600126]},{"nodeId":716600126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3586732362,"text":"鶯はその場から去った。","nextNodeIds":[716600127]},{"nodeId":716600127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":106628578,"text":"はぁ、結局誘えなかった。","nextNodeIds":[716600128]},{"nodeId":716600128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3660745298,"text":"けど、鶯さんにはたくさん迷惑をかけたし、これ以上邪魔するわけにもいかないよな。","nextNodeIds":[716600129]},{"nodeId":716600129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":2479906914,"text":"ここは一度落ち着いて、タイミングを見計らったほうが…","nextNodeIds":[716600130]},{"nodeId":716600130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3677250906,"text":"ティマイオス、なに一人でぶつぶつ言ってるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[716600131]},{"nodeId":716600131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":367728378,"text":"あっ、いや何でもない！","nextNodeIds":[716600132]},{"nodeId":716600132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":954744354,"text":"今回は本当にありがとう！約束通り、「万民堂」で二人に美味しい食事をご馳走するよ！","nextNodeIds":[716600133]},{"nodeId":716600133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":16488754,"text":"忘れるところだった…","nextNodeIds":[716600134]},{"nodeId":716600134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3888097026,"text":"おお、そうだった。ごちそう、ごちそう～！早く行こうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[716600135]},{"nodeId":716600135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3941591370,"text":"ティマイオスと一緒に「万民堂」で豪華な食事をした。","nextNodeIds":[716600136]},{"nodeId":716600136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":862293226,"text":"ぷはぁ…お腹いっぱい、大満足だぜ！","nextNodeIds":[716600137]},{"nodeId":716600137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4157192506,"text":"ティマイオス！今回の研究、なかなか面白かったな！今度また璃月に来ることがあったら、オイラたちも誘ってくれよ！","nextNodeIds":[716600138,716600139]},{"nodeId":716600138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":92073666,"text":"パイモンは研究に興味ないでしょ？","nextNodeIds":[716600140]},{"nodeId":716600140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3821930562,"text":"なんだよそれ！オイラだって役に立っただろ…たとえば、道を聞いたりとか！","nextNodeIds":[716600141]},{"nodeId":716600141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":601766178,"text":"とにかく、二人とも感謝するよ！","nextNodeIds":[716600142]},{"nodeId":716600142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3797742802,"text":"けどモンドに戻ったら、しばらくは「煙霰ポーション」の改良に専念したいと思う。当分、璃月へ来ることはないだろうね。","nextNodeIds":[716600143]},{"nodeId":716600143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":4040361546,"text":"ただ近いうち、僕の手紙を届けてもらえないだろうか。鶯さんにまだ感謝の気持ちを伝えられてないからね。","nextNodeIds":[716600144]},{"nodeId":716600144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3595191546,"text":"え？ずっと二人で話してたんだろ？なんで直接言わなかったんだよ？","nextNodeIds":[716600145]},{"nodeId":716600145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3776611482,"text":"そ、それは鶯さんの言葉遣いが実に…独特だったから！きちんと言葉を選んで感謝を伝えるには、直接話すよりも手紙のほうがいいかと思って…","nextNodeIds":[716600146]},{"nodeId":716600146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":3562231098,"text":"それよりも時間が惜しい。早くモンドに戻ろう。今は一刻も早く、完璧な「煙霰ポーション」を作りたいんだ！","nextNodeIds":[716600147]},{"nodeId":716600147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2557324362,"text":"なんだか鶯と別れた後から、ティマイオスの様子がおかしくないか？","nextNodeIds":[716600148]},{"nodeId":716600148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3334220650,"text":"う～ん、なにがあったんだ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":716600139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2146565802,"text":"ただ美味しいものが食べたいだけでは？","nextNodeIds":[716600140]},{"nodeId":716600105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2968316634,"text":"まだ改善の余地がある。","nextNodeIds":[716600106]},{"nodeId":716600106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2469632186,"text":"そうだな、例えば…秘境の外でも使えるようにするとか！","nextNodeIds":[716600107]},{"nodeId":716600107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","textMapHash":288254850,"text":"うん、鶯さんともちょうどその問題について話してたんだ。君たちが行った実験を詳しく話してくれるかい？","nextNodeIds":[716600108]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7166001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["1587"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7166001],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1587,"speakerName":"ティマイオス","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":13},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2083,"speakerName":"鶯","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171660],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4053526518,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"1587":[1190],"2083":[1170]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Liyue_71660/Q7166001","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST"